erify rather than trust, make termination mechanical, and run independent work in parallel. ZeroPaper runs on Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, and Gemini CLI, with variants for finance and macro and extensions for empirical analysis and LLM experiments."}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W7150754777", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.62311/nesx/rp3-30042026", "title": "Explainable Quantum-Logical Multi-Agent Systems for Autonomous Scientific Discovery in High-Dimensional Research Landscapes", "publication_year": 2026, "type": "article", "cited_by_count": 0, "open_access": {"is_oa": true, "oa_status": "bronze", "oa_url": "https://www.nationaleducationservices.org/file-download/1620346/Download Full-Text Research Paper PDF-A3.pdf", "any_repository_has_fulltext": false}, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.62311/nesx/rp3-30042026", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.62311/nesx/rp3-30042026", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_ur

